WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.562
Duuɓi mawɓe Babatou. Ɗuum ko haala taariika, ɗum laaɓɓi ngam hollaago.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.368
Ɓaawo karnijum 19th Nder gariiri gooruusi, nguurndam ɗon tokkata wakkati.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.128
Ammaa nder le'i, ɓe ɗon yahda bee konne'en zarma Babatou.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.834
Ɓe njooɗoto worɓe ngam ɓe kuuwana ɓe. Yimɓe cappanon ɗon njaha, ɓe ngaɗata ko'e maɓɓe.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.914
Ngam maajum yimɓe saare fuu ɗon njanngina ngam ɓe njooɗoo. To goɗɗo ɗon dari dow suudu, mo ɗon laɓɓina yimɓe fuu.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:17.126
Dammugal! Juŋŋgo'en ɗon wara!

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Ɗuum ɓooyaama haa to fannu.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.126
Walaa mo dartata. Koo moye to nokkuure muuɗum!

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.720
Debbo'en e sukaaɓe ɗon ɓoyma nder cuuɗi ɗi cembiɗɗi.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.984
Yimɓe ɗon kaɓɓaa ko'e, ɓe ɓooyataa ɗe bee lekki.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.416
Fuuje e figeere ɗon haɓɓaa.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:16.122
Hakkiilo ɗon wara. Yimɓe ɗon njooɗii dow ko'e maɓɓe ɓe mbaɗi jaalorgal.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.320
Ammaa ko'e koyɗe ɗe cembiɗaaki.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.848
Daga nder cuuɗi ɗeen, fuɗɗiima ƴeewugo.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:07.282
Yimɓe ɗon njooɗoto. Yimɓe nder gariiri ɗon njooɗi.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.296
Nder nyalnde nde'e, yimɓe ɗon mbi'a ɓe jaalortoo.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:37.668
Yimɓe gariiri ɓadake'en ɗon paama daliila maajum. To ɓe goonɗinɓe tan, ɓe njogii. Ɓe njokki hoore maɓɓe.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.984
Ɓe ɗon ceede, ɓe ɗon haɓana.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:08.352
Hannde, yimɓe ɗon nji'a haɓre nden e yimɓe ɓe mbaawataa hisnaade.
